  DTS:Description="Applies the cost-centre allocation rules: shared-service costs are spread across receiving cost centres on the driver stored with the rule (headcount, floor area or revenue share), and the allocated result is folded into the finance close summary aggregate. Allocation runs in rule-sequence order because later rules allocate the output of earlier ones."
